{"overview":"در جهانی که هدایای جادویی سرنوشت‌تان را تعیین می‌کنند، توانایی نادر لنت اجازه می‌دهد نقاط جادوی خود را به دیگران قرض دهد؛ او گروهی ماجراجویی به نام Skypiercers را با دوستانش تشکیل می‌دهد، آن‌ها را به قهرمانان قدرتمند تبدیل می‌کند، اما در نهایت به‌عنوان وزن مرده کنار می‌زنند؛ خشمگین، لنت قدرت واقعی هدایای خود را بیدار می‌کند: جمع‌آوری اجباری، قدرت بازپس‌گیری جادو؛ انتقام او اکنون آغاز می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In a world where magical Gifts determine your destiny, Lent’s rare ability lets him lend his magic points to others. He forms an adventuring party called the Skypiercers with his friends, helping them become powerful heroes, only to be later cast aside as dead weight. Furious, Lent awakens the true power of his Gift: Forced Collection, the power to repossess magic. His revenge starts now.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/awhhCPGdZXe0iMVOXwYmkDrWKm3.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"川島零士","role":"Lent (voice)","photo":"/tJriYA3tctzKP3ZnAwsxkey9iyU.jpg","en":"Reiji Kawashima"},{"name":"加藤英美里","role":"Empee (voice)","photo":"/m0zqjeg65sEe5TTy4mKqgwXVipI.jpg","en":"Emiri Kato"},{"name":"松田利冴","role":"Linka (voice)","photo":"/7bUMIZ3S1Wc73d5wgNCyiLYUhyU.jpg","en":"Risae Matsuda"},{"name":"濱野大輝","role":"Guy (voice)","photo":"/bykeH3Rhmx9PPFegYNi6s310cNa.jpg","en":"Daiki Hamano"},{"name":"関根明良","role":"Misa (voice)","photo":"/czYoPzAEK1gI7RxRiPyDSFYRm5x.jpg","en":"Akira Sekine"},{"name":"小林ゆう","role":"Elle (voice)","photo":"/p3OKrnliz2C8ub14Pn5pN3T8Q9B.jpg","en":"Yu Kobayashi"},{"name":"浪川大輔","role":"Roger (voice)","photo":"/iw0X8oDutxaBAri3Ifga8nhdUJK.jpg","en":"Daisuke Namikawa"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/333622/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":